# Cursor Agent Ignore (Unity)
#
# 目标：
# - 默认让 Agent 聚焦在 C# 逻辑与关键配置上
# - 排除 Unity 生成/缓存/构建产物与大体量二进制资源，减少噪音与索引成本
#
# 需要排查资源引用/合并冲突时，你可以临时把下面的 *.prefab / *.unity / *.meta 规则删掉或注释掉。

# --- Unity 生成目录（必须排除） ---
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
Build/
Builds/
Logs/
UserSettings/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/
Packages/packages-lock.json

# --- 大体量二进制资源（通常对 Agent 没价值） ---
*.fbx
*.FBX
*.obj
*.OBJ
*.3ds
*.3DS
*.lxo
*.LXO
*.ma
*.MA
*.blend
*.blend1
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.tga
*.tif
*.tiff
*.psd
*.ico
*.bmp
*.svg
*.webp
*.exr
*.hdr
*.cubemap
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.aif
*.aiff
*.mid
*.midi
*.dll
*.exe
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.pdb
*.mdb

# --- Unity 序列化文件（默认排除，按需放开） ---
*.meta
*.asset
*.mat
*.physicMaterial
*.flare
*.controller
*.overrideController
*.anim
*.mask
*.lighting
*.giparams
*.renderTexture

# --- IDE 生成文件 ---
.vs/
.idea/

# --- 系统/杂项 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
ServerData/
*.unitypackage
crashlytics-build.properties